# FYP Development & Thesis Files
# The LaTeX SOURCES are tracked — they are small, they are the writing, and
# they benefit from history. Everything else in the folder is ignored: the
# diagram exports run to several megabytes and change on every re-export, and
# main.pdf is a build artefact.
#
# Note the syntax: the directory itself must NOT be excluded, only its
# contents. Git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded,
# so `BS_FYP_development/` followed by a negation would silently not work.
BS_FYP_development/*
!BS_FYP_development/*.tex
!BS_FYP_development/*.bib
